<title>SWEDEN: Enskilda upgrades Ericsson/Nokia to buy - sources.</title>
<headline>Enskilda upgrades Ericsson/Nokia to buy - sources.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enskilda, the investment banking arm of Swedish bank S-E-Banken, has upgraded its trading recommendation on telecoms groups Ericsson and Nokia to buy from outperform, sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A market source told Reuters the two companies were upgraded this week.  </p>
<p>Both companies were trading higher by midday Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ericsson climbed four crowns in morning trade to 177 crowns while Nokia was up five markka at 210.50.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
